{
  "source": "Prompts/trust-trap-v7.mp4",
  "duration": 141.2053125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.48,
      "text": "We know AI is amazing, fantastic, and well, you can insert your own superlative right"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.48,
      "end": 5.7,
      "text": "here."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.16,
      "end": 9.6,
      "text": "How much should you trust it when you're the one making a high stakes decision?"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.0,
      "end": 13.0,
      "text": "Take a universally stressful choice, like picking a college."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.7,
      "end": 16.72,
      "text": "Let's test this by asking the exact same question twice."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.48,
      "end": 22.14,
      "text": "Once at the dinner table, and once in a chat window, should I choose Michigan or Indiana?"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.82,
      "end": 27.91,
      "text": "On the left side, your mom says, Indiana, you seemed more comfortable there, and when you"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.91,
      "end": 29.19,
      "text": "get stuck, you tend to go quiet."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.89,
      "end": 33.13,
      "text": "Being somewhere you'll ask for help matters more for you than another ranking."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.63,
      "end": 37.15,
      "text": "She actually knows you and holds a personal stake in your future happiness."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.91,
      "end": 39.45,
      "text": "The chatbot responds, Michigan."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.11,
      "end": 42.89,
      "text": "It offers world-class academics in a vibrant campus community."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.37,
      "end": 44.71,
      "text": "It could be an excellent fit for you."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.15,
      "end": 47.77,
      "text": "The chatbot only knows what you typed into the prompt box."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.23,
      "end": 52.21,
      "text": "It has never seen how you act when you're stuck, overwhelmed, or struggling."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.67,
      "end": 54.53,
      "text": "It has no stake in which school you choose."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.99,
      "end": 55.87,
      "text": "Which one would you trust?"
    },
    {
      "start": 55.87,
      "end": 61.75,
      "text": "The AI's response is confident, highly polished, and incredibly easy to like."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.43,
      "end": 65.83,
      "text": "But read it closely, and you realize it is completely generic."
    },
    {
      "start": 66.67,
      "end": 70.23,
      "text": "It could have been generated for almost any student anywhere in the country."
    },
    {
      "start": 70.87,
      "end": 75.53,
      "text": "Trustrap is giving a human-sounding answer the trust you would give someone who knows"
    },
    {
      "start": 75.53,
      "end": 75.73,
      "text": "you."
    },
    {
      "start": 76.33,
      "end": 78.53,
      "text": "First, AI sounds like a person."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.27,
      "end": 84.41,
      "text": "The software uses generated pronouns, like I think and I feel, which tricks your brain"
    },
    {
      "start": 84.41,
      "end": 85.71,
      "text": "into hearing a human voice."
    },
    {
      "start": 86.53,
      "end": 90.65,
      "text": "Those are strictly statistically generated words, not genuine thoughts or feelings."
    },
    {
      "start": 91.59,
      "end": 94.19,
      "text": "Second, your brain naturally looks for a person."
    },
    {
      "start": 94.85,
      "end": 99.31,
      "text": "When you receive a conversational response, you automatically begin searching for a persona"
    },
    {
      "start": 99.31,
      "end": 100.17,
      "text": "behind the text."
    },
    {
      "start": 100.85,
      "end": 106.59,
      "text": "AI is an excellent tool for gathering facts, organizing complex options, and even challenging"
    },
    {
      "start": 106.59,
      "end": 109.33,
      "text": "your initial assumptions based on the data you feed it."
    },
    {
      "start": 109.75,
      "end": 113.95,
      "text": "But processing data is completely different from shared human experience."
    },
    {
      "start": 114.77,
      "end": 119.39,
      "text": "A mentor understands your history and shares the burden of living with the outcome of your"
    },
    {
      "start": 119.39,
      "end": 119.71,
      "text": "choices."
    },
    {
      "start": 120.61,
      "end": 123.11,
      "text": "So use the chatbots to do your research."
    },
    {
      "start": 123.87,
      "end": 125.21,
      "text": "Let them lay out the pros and cons."
    },
    {
      "start": 126.09,
      "end": 130.61,
      "text": "But before you finalize a major life choice, talk it through with the people who actually"
    },
    {
      "start": 130.61,
      "end": 131.25,
      "text": "know you."
    },
    {
      "start": 131.73,
      "end": 134.41,
      "text": "Sounding human doesn't make AI human."
    },
    {
      "start": 135.17,
      "end": 137.63,
      "text": "For important decisions, talk to people who know you."
    }
  ],
